        "@id": "edm:hasMentor"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "edm:mergedToForm",
      "@type": "owl:ObjectProperty",
      "schema:domainIncludes": {
        "@id": "edm:Thing"
      },
      "schema:rangeIncludes": {
        "@id": "edm:Thing"
      },
      "rdfs:comment": "Used to connect entities of the same type merged together to form another entity of that type. When entity A and B are merged to form entity C, entity A is mergedWith entity B, entity A is mergedToForm entity C and entity B is also mergedToForm entity C. Entity A and B cease to exist after the merger whereas entity C did not exist prior to the merger.",
      "rdfs:label": "merged to form",
      "owl:equivalentProperty": "http://id.loc.gov/ontologies/bibframe/mergedToForm",
      "owl:inverseOf": {
        "@id": "edm:mergerOf"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "edm:mergedWith",
      "@type": [
        "owl:ObjectProperty",
        "owl:SymmetricProperty"
      ],
      "schema:domainIncludes": {
        "@id": "edm:Thing"
      },
      "schema:rangeIncludes": {
        "@id": "edm:Thing"
      },
      "rdfs:comment": "Used to connect two or more entities of the same type that merge with each othe to form another entity of that type. mergedWith is used in combination with mergedToForm. When entity A and B are merged to form entity C, entity A is mergedWith entity B, entity A is mergedToForm entity C and entity B is also mergedToForm entity C. Entity A and B cease to exist after the merger whereas entity C did not exist prior to the merger. This relation is symmetric, when entity A is merged with B then B is merged with A.",
      "rdfs:label": "merged with",
      "owl:equivalentProperty": "http://id.loc.gov/ontologies/bibframe/mergedWith",
      "owl:inverseOf": {
        "@id": "edm:mergedWith"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "edm:mergerOf",
      "@type": "owl:ObjectProperty",
      "schema:domainIncludes": {
        "@id": "edm:Thing"
      },
      "schema:rangeIncludes": {
        "@id": "edm:Thing"
      },
      "rdfs:comment": "Used to connect the entity which is the result of a merger of two or more entities of the same type. When an entity A is the result of the mergerOf entity B and the mergerOf entity C then entities B and C merged with each other to form A. Entity A comes into existence after the merger whereas entities B and C cease to exist after the merger.",
      "rdfs:label": "merger of",
      "owl:equivalentProperty": "http://id.loc.gov/ontologies/bibframe/mergerOf",
      "owl:inverseOf": {
        "@id": "edm:mergedToForm"
      }
    },
