      "rdfs:comment": "This relation links a real-world instance or Activity to a CreativeWork (such as a Course, CreativePerformance or CreativeComposition, where the Activity concretely realizes, delivers, or performs the conceptual work. See `edm:hasRealization` for examples.",
      "rdfs:label": "realization of",
